 "text": "18 ml of a 15% strength solution of sodium methylate in methanol were added dropwise, at room temperature, to a suspension of 25.4 g of 3,7-dichloro-8-triphenylphosphoniummethylquinoline chloride and 11.3 g of 3,7-dichloro-8-formylquinoline in 150 ml of ethanol. The mixture was stirred for 2 hours, after which the yellow precipitate was filtered off under suction, treated with water and again filtered off under suction.",
